; pl-b-fix1177-01 - expression matrix: context pl, value set B, 4 cells
; fixed cells of #1177 (a comparison is computed in the type so far of
; its context, not with its operands' own values): the checks have the
; port's values, the original's are the declared deviations of the test
; generated by exprmatrix expect from
; tests/corpus/tests-exprmatrix/matrix.txt (tools/exprmatrix/README.md);
; do not edit
DEFTYPE .l gl
Statement pl{x.l}
  SHARED gl
  gl=x
End Statement
!TestCase{cells}
  vq.q=-1.5
  pl{vq = -1.5} : !CheckEq{gl,-1,"pl-eq-q-cf-B"}
  pl{vq <> -1.5} : !CheckEq{gl,0,"pl-ne-q-cf-B"}
  pl{vq < -1.5} : !CheckEq{gl,0,"pl-lt-q-cf-B"}
  pl{vq >= -1.5} : !CheckEq{gl,-1,"pl-ge-q-cf-B"}
!EndTestCase
